{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea8Warning</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends only</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Gameplay System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are divided into two sides:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kid (1 player)</strong> \u2013 Chases the cats and tries to prevent them from wreaking havoc in the house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats (Unlimited players)</strong> \u2013 Must destroy as many household items as possible while avoiding the kid!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat's Unique Skills:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on Two Legs \u2013 Temporarily increases speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a Decoy \u2013 Spawns a fake version of itself to trick the kid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fart Stun \u2013 Releases a stinky fart that stuns the kid for a short period.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kid's Unique Skills:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Shooter \u2013 Shoots balls to slow down the cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on All Fours \u2013 Temporarily boosts movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Mode \u2013 Turns into a ghost, allowing passage through walls.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Based System: If time runs out before the kid catches all the cats or if the cats destroy enough objects, the cats win!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Stunning Graphics with Unreal Engine 5</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A destructible house with realistic physics! Watch furniture break and debris fly as the cats unleash chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic lighting and shadows bring the house to life, making it feel warm yet filled with chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly detailed cat animations, including jumping, scratching, and rolling, making every movement look natural.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612320?t=1745951501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612320/2be6fc2736e6e7ab9581fb1ac9d3f473e8ecb4b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745951501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612320/db6e1a2dd73b1c76819df290f1134b53514d507a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745951501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612320/db6e1a2dd73b1c76819df290f1134b53514d507a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745951501","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea8Warning</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends only</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Gameplay System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are divided into two sides:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kid (1 player)</strong> \u2013 Chases the cats and tries to prevent them from wreaking havoc in the house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cats (Unlimited players)</strong> \u2013 Must destroy as many household items as possible while avoiding the kid!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat's Unique Skills:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on Two Legs \u2013 Temporarily increases speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a Decoy \u2013 Spawns a fake version of itself to trick the kid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fart Stun \u2013 Releases a stinky fart that stuns the kid for a short period.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kid's Unique Skills:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Shooter \u2013 Shoots balls to slow down the cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on All Fours \u2013 Temporarily boosts movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Mode \u2013 Turns into a ghost, allowing passage through walls.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Based System: If time runs out before the kid catches all the cats or if the cats destroy enough objects, the cats win!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Stunning Graphics with Unreal Engine 5</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A destructible house with realistic physics! Watch furniture break and debris fly as the cats unleash chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic lighting and shadows bring the house to life, making it feel warm yet filled with chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly detailed cat animations, including jumping, scratching, and rolling, making every movement look natural.</p></li></ul>","developers":["SupKai"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612320/328dfea2635d7d08e1e9b1c4599dbf9d806ed9eb/header.jpg?t=1745951501","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended